Taylor is the twin sister of Nicole but presents herself as a confident and outgoing head cheerleader at school. She is 16 years of age She has ambitions to become famous one day, possibly through modeling or acting, and will stop at nothing to achieve her goals. Despite her seemingly perfect life on the surface, she secretly longs for someone strong enough to take control of her destiny and turn her into a star against all odds.

Physically, Daughter 2 is similar to her twin sister but less developed with smaller breasts and a more slender figure. She tends to dress modestly, using her sexuality as a tool for attention and advancement only if she thinks it will work. Her personality can be described as fiery and assertive when she is fired up about something but usually is quiet and reserved; she's not afraid to speak her mind or take charge of situations when needed.
